        "output": "Sample Quality Vector:  [101.2, 5.8, 2.4]\nTarget Process Means:   [100.0, 5.0, 2.0]\nCalculated Hotelling T2: 5.78 (UCL: 14.16)\nOperational Verdict:    IN_STATISTICAL_CONTROL"
